nvc 1.23.1 stops with an internal error ("variable and stored value do not
have same type", lower_cond_value) on conditional expressions whose values
are strings or bit vectors of different lengths. The golden follows
IEEE 1076-2019 §9.1: the value of the conditional expression is the value
of the selected expression, so w has the selected string's bounds and the
actual of len its own length.
